Task: "Please provide a recipe for high protein flatbread"

Return JSON: {"braincode": "..."}

--- RESPONSE ---
{"braincode": "ENTRYPOINT $main\n\nTASK $main : PROPOSITION {\n  GENERATE(target=entity_recipe, specification=intent_provide_recipe(dish=entity_flatbread, protein_level=value_high)) -> $recipe : PROPOSITION\n  RETURN $recipe\n}"}

