   "membership_rule": "A member has exact form int_[a-z0-9_]+ and is valid only if the complete glossary defines a unique schema with required and optional attributes, allowed value types/categories, and fixed argument order. Canonical construct selection is mandatory: encode an observed or requested dialogue sequence, correction, reply relation, or speaker identity as CONVO with TURN and UTTER; encode an executable external-state request as TASK; encode a request solely for a newly derived symbolic artifact as TASK containing GENERATE. Do not use CONVO for a one-shot artifact request and do not use GENERATE when a glossary-defined external operation is required.",
