  "nl": "Help me to create a text about my decision to go to Japan to learn about SGI. Only 100 words.",
  "trajectory_steps": [
   "assistant: Since my first encounter with Soka Gakkai International (SGI) five years ago, I have felt a deep pull toward its philosophy of peace, education, and human revolution. The teachings emphasize compassion, empowerment, and community, resonating with my personal values. To truly understand its roots and practice, I decided to travel to Japan, the birthplace of SGI. Immersing myself in local traditions, attending meetings, and studying the original texts will deepen my grasp and allow me to share authentic insights with my community. This journey is not merely tourism; it is a purposeful pursuit of knowledge and spiritual growth, and transformation.",
